        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BGH100SCVSS4, Stainless Steel Bighorn \"S\" Curve Grip Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel S Door Handle is a stunning example of modern design that is not boxy. The free flowing movement of this Modern Wave Door Pull makes it a great accent for any contemporary space. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from satin stainless steel, polished stainless steel, matte black, or lithonia (oil rubbed bronze powder coat) finishes.  Available in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BGH03-specifcations.gif?v=1704354681\" width=\"600\" height=\"222\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" alt=\"First Impressions BGH100SCVSS4 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BGH100012SCVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BGH100024SCVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BGH100036SCVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Requires 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel S Door Handle | Modern Wave Door Pull",
                "description": "The Stainless Steel S Door Handle is a stunning example of modern design that is not boxy. The free flowing movement of this Modern Wave Door Pull makes it a great accent for any contemporary space. It can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from satin stainless steel, polished stainless steel, matte black, or lithonia (oil rubbed bronze powder coat) finishes.  Available in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Modern Wave Door Pulls, Stainless Steel S Door Handles, First Impressions BGH03, FII-BGH03, Bighorn S Curve Grip Door Pulls, Bighorn collection series 3, modern wave pulls, contemporary wave pulls, FII-BGH03012 12 inch pulls, FII-BGH03024 24 inch pulls, FII-BGH03036 36 inch pulls, stainless steel door pulls, stainless steel door handles, black door pulls, FII-BGH100SCVSS4, First Impressions BGH100SCVSS4"
